flowchart TB
    Remote[Remote Buzz event\nUNTRUSTED] --> Validate[Kind + channel + schema\nexpiry + author validation]
    Validate --> Policy[Typed policy core\nallowlists + fee + state]
    Suggestion[LLM suggestion\nUNTRUSTED] --> Policy
    Policy --> Prepare[Non-mutating prepare]
    Prepare --> Approval[Local human approval\nexact triple]
    Approval --> Adapter[Settlement adapter]
    Adapter --> Wallet[Wallet CLI / daemon]
    Wallet --> Receipt[Recipient-side activity verification]
    Receipt --> Audit[Receipt + audit trail]
    Remote -. cannot authorize .-> Wallet
    Suggestion -. cannot authorize .-> Wallet
